  "parameter_rationale": {
    "distribution": "The PPO entropy bonus uses a fresh current-policy Monte Carlo estimate after tanh; pre-tanh Normal entropy is diagnostic only. Bounded log standard deviation and a frozen linear entropy schedule prevent hidden clamp drift and unbounded noise.",
    "reward_budget": "Gamma 0.999, a 500-step horizon, route and success scales of 20, explicit unfinished timeout failure and -50 collision/offroad costs satisfy the seven pre-registered trajectory orderings without positive speed or centreline dwell reward.",
    "lane_center": "The current Driving-lane centre has a 0.5 m zero-cost deadzone and only a bounded non-positive deviation cost outside it. A ten-tick grace follows a legal broken-line crossing so necessary merging is not charged as centreline failure.",
    "curriculum": "Difficulty stages are cumulative, but promotion is driven only by two consecutive frozen rollout windows passing both per-agent motion/completion/brake thresholds and team outcome limits. Update count alone cannot promote.",
    "compatibility": "This is a fresh-only schema-v6 contract with a 20-dimensional time-aware observation. Schema-v5 checkpoints, including the failed u50 artifact, remain historical read-only evidence and cannot resume or be selected under R6.",
    "scope": "This u100 run is diagnostic-only. Actors remain independent, behavior cloning is disabled, and every produced checkpoint is forbidden from formal C0 selection and the base-policy pool. Its purpose is to distinguish persistent collapse from late escape without changing R6 scientific parameters."
